<h1>@GlobalValues.CSS_Name_CSS_Classes @GlobalValues.Common_Page_Title_Variables</h1>

<p>
    As discussed on the overview page, <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">BlazorRamp.CssClasses</span> utilises the same core CSS variables from the <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">BlazorRamp.Core</span> 
    package consumed by the components, as well as creating others specific to its needs, without straying form the core -<span class="@CodeSpan.Base">-br-unit-*</span> values.
</p>
<p>
    The following CSS variables are only consumed by the classes outlined later in the <span class="@CodeSpan.Base">BlazorRamp.CssClasses</span> documentation.
</p>

